lls are excretory organelles"}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Parasitology","displayTopic":"Medical Parasitology","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-4d161a77a5eb","stem":"In hookworm infections which of the following would you recommend as the","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Parasitology","topic":"Medical Parasitology","topicOriginal":"Medical Parasitology","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"Albendazole alone"},{"label":"B","text":"Albendazole and Iron supplements"},{"label":"C","text":"Praziquantel and Ivermectin"},{"label":"D","text":"Mebendazole alone"},{"label":"E","text":"None of the above SECTION C: FILL LIN BLANKS (20 points) (One mark for each correct response)"}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Parasitology","displayTopic":"Medical Parasitology","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-9ee5f74aab64","stem":"List the Trematodes of Public Health importance that infect man. For each parasite indicate the specific location(s) in the human hoist. Choose one in blood and outline its life cycle. SECTION 1 Instructions: In the answer sheet provided indicate by marking (x) in the space for TRUE or FALSE for each of the following statements. An incorrect response will have a penalty of a quarter mark. Unfilled space will be considered as ‘don’t know’ and will have no penalty (100 POINTS).","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Parasitology","topic":"Medical Parasitology","topicOriginal":"Medical Parasitology","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","fla