},{"id":"q-ff96dd23da48","stem":"Serum cholesterol levels for two groups of Tanzanians were recorded in 2001. The mean cholesterol level for a group of 28 Wachaggas was 271 mg/dl and 184 mg/dl for a group of 25 Makondes. Tribe and their eating habits were main determinants of cholesterol levels. This study can best be described as","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Community Health and Public Health","topic":"Epidemiology","topicOriginal":"Epidemiology","subtopic":"Epidemiolog","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"descriptive study"},{"label":"B","text":"analytical study"},{"label":"C","text":"none of the above"},{"label":"D","text":"both a and b Look at the figure below and answer questions 53 and 54 [pic]"}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Community Health and Public Health","displayTopic":"Epidemiology","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-04b1e1375c25","stem":"This study can best be described as","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Community Health and Public Health","topic":"Epidemiology","topicOriginal":"Epidemiology","subtopic":"Epidemiolog","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"Descriptive study"},{"label":"B","text":"Analytical study"},{"label":"C","text":"None of the above"},{"label":"D","text":"Both a and b"}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Community Health and Public Health","displayTopic":"Epidemiology","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-e1be1ad7d869","stem":"In the study above, breastfeeding is","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Community Health and Public Health",